  "你买的东西，八成走过海": "Most of what you buy came by sea",
  "按 UNCTAD 的统计，国际贸易约八成的货物量靠海运。看着它出现：几百个光点亮起来，铺满全球干线航道。": "UNCTAD counts about four fifths of world trade by volume as seaborne. Watch it appear: hundreds of lights switch on and fill the world’s trunk routes.",
  "它们只穿过几个针眼": "And they all squeeze through a few needle eyes",
  "大洋很宽，干线却全挤在七处针眼上。逐个亮起来：马六甲、霍尔木兹、苏伊士、曼德、丹麦、博斯普鲁斯、巴拿马。环上是真实的石油通过量。": "The oceans are wide, yet the trunk routes crowd into seven narrow gaps. One by one: Malacca, Hormuz, Suez, Bab el-Mandeb, the Danish Straits, the Bosphorus, Panama. Each ring carries its real oil throughput.",
  "关掉苏伊士": "Shut the Suez",
