  "2021 年真的堵过六天": "In 2021 it really was blocked for six days",
  "长赐号横在河道里，苏伊士停摆六天，Lloyd’s List 估每天约 96 亿美元货值被拦在两头。这不是假设。": "The Ever Given lay across the channel and the Suez stood still for six days. Lloyd’s List put the cargo held up at about $9.6 billion a day. This is not a hypothetical.",
  "全部打开，控制权交还给你。点地图上的环，或者用底栏芯片，一个一个关，看世界怎样被逐步掐断。": "Everything reopens and the controls are yours. Tap a ring on the map or a chip below, shut them one at a time, and watch the world get squeezed."
